      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it just feels so exhausting. like, why bother trying to weave something new when the material is just... gone? everything feels so hollow. sometimes i think the only honest thing left to do is just stop pretending. because there's nothing underneath this anymore. just emptiness.",
